    "https://www.kenyon.edu/careers-outcomes/fellowships-awards/": {
      "title": "Fellowships & Awards",
      "description": "Fellowships & Awards | Kenyon College Skip to main content Kenyon College Home Calls to Action Navigation Apply Visit Menu You are here: Home Careers & Outcomes Fellowships & Awards Fellowships & Awards Pursue excellence, explore your passion and chart a course for your future. Explore This Section Close Explore This Section Career Development Office Internships Fellowships & Awards After Kenyon The Kenyon Network Outcomes Report 2025 At Kenyon, mentoring and teaching go hand in hand, so our students come out on top — consistently earning national scholarships and prestigious postgraduate fellowships. What’s our secret? Exceptionally prepared students who give and receive great attention. Fulbright Force Year in and year out, Kenyon is a top bachelor institution for producing Fulbright Fellows. Learn more about Fulbrights . #2 in the country among Division III institutions for producing NCAA Postgraduate Scholars. Goldwater Glory Kenyon students are regularly recognized with Goldwater Scholarships, the most competitive undergraduate award in the sciences. 47 NSF Graduate Research Fellowships have been awarded since 2010 to Kenyon alumni pursuing doctoral research. “When I was applying for my Fulbright, I think I went through 18 or 20 drafts with Professor Camerra-Rowe. I really took the time to consider every word that I wrote, so that I could be the best possible applicant.” Nick Kaufman ’19 Policy Analyst, U.S.-China Economic and Security Review Commission We’re here to help. Kenyon’s Office of National Fellowships & Scholarships helps current students and recent graduates identify and pursue prestigious fellowship opportunities and programs, providing resources and guidance throughout the application process and partnering closely with faculty mentors. Contact us to discuss which fellowship may be best for you. Office of National Fellowships & Scholarships Newsworthy Honors Kenyon Again Named Top Producer of Fulbrights Kenyon News The College’s streak of ranking as a top producer among liberal arts institutions for the Fulbright U.S. Student Program continued this year. Categories Kenyon in the World Kenyon Grad Named Marshall Scholar Kenyon News The prestigious award will support the graduate work of Sam Bowden ’24 in Eastern European history and languages while in the United Kingdom. Categories Kenyon in the World Working Across Disciplines Kenyon News Triple major Lee Nah ’25 is the first Kenyon student in 15 years to win the Beinecke Scholarship and plans to use the award to continue her innovative interdisciplinary work. Categories Kenyon in the World Striking Gold Kenyon News Kenyon students win Goldwater Scholarships, continuing the College’s run of success with the premier award for undergraduate research. Categories Science Kenyon Address Gambier , Ohio 43022 , USA Phone 740-427-5000 Connect Navigation Instagram Facebook YouTube LinkedIn tiktok Visiting Kenyon Navigation Directions Campus Map Kenyon Commits To Navigation Mission & Values Accessibility Non-Discrimination Privacy Kenyon Affiliates Brown Family Environmental Center The Gund Kenyon Review Philander Chase Conservancy Footer Navigation Employment Bookstore Emergency Title IX Policies Make a Gift © Copyright 2026 Site Menu Secondary Navigation Apply Give News Events Directory Offices & Services Search Submit CTAs Navigation Apply Visit Site Navigation Academics Departments and Majors Our Faculty Advising & Resources Experiential Learning Global Learning Student Research Writing at Kenyon Library Academic Calendar Admissions & Aid Visit Kenyon Apply to Kenyon Financial Aid & Scholarships Connect with Us Request Information Campus Life Inclusion & Belonging Residential Life Dining on Campus Health & Safety Civic Engagement Sustainability & Green Initiatives Clubs & Organizations Arts & Culture Careers & Outcomes Career Development Office Internships Fellowships & Awards After Kenyon The Kenyon Network Outcomes Report 2025 Athletics Secondary Navigation Apply Give News Events Directory Offices & Services Explore Kenyon Navigation in brief in pictures in numbers in our own words in the world on a tour Links For Navigation Current Students Faculty & Staff Parents & Families Alumni Community New Students Close"
